{"book":"2samuel","num":18,"verses":[{"en":"And David numbered the people that were with him, and set captains of thousands and captains of hundreds over them.","n":1,"sm":"Ua faitauina e Tavita le nuu ua ia te ia, ma na tofia foi o alii o taitoaafe ma alii o taitoaselau e pule ia i latou.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"","sm":"faitauina"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"Tavita"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"nuu"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"ia,"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"na"},{"en":"","sm":"tofia"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"alii"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"taitoaafe"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"alii"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"taitoaselau"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"pule"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"latou."}]},{"en":"And David sent forth a third part of the people under the hand of Joab, and a third part under the hand of Abishai the son of Zeruiah, Joab's brother, and a third part under the hand of Ittai the Gittite. And the king said unto the people, I will surely go forth with you myself also.","n":2,"sm":"Ua tuu atu e Tavita le nuu ua vaetoluina, o le tasi vaega i le pule a Ioapo, ma le tasi ona vaega i le pule a Apisai le tama a Seruia, le uso o Ioapo, ma le isi ona vaega i le pule a Itai le sa Kata; ua fai ane foi le tupu i le nuu, O aʻu foi, tatou te o lava faatasi ma outou.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"","sm":"tuu"},{"en":"","sm":"atu"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"Tavita"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"nuu"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"vaetoluina,"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"tasi"},{"en":"","sm":"vaega"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"pule"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"Ioapo,"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"tasi"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"vaega"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"